{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Vanessa and the Cooking Accident", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Natural Remedies", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 8, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 10, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.3", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Describe complicated or unusual events in the past through a wider range of B1 language in both work and social contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Writes well-organized texts or articles about explaining the rules and regulations in his/her industry using appropriate grammar, vocabulary, spelling coherence and cohesion, and different levels of formality.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Writes well-organized texts or articles about explaining the rules and regulations in his/her industry using appropriate grammar, vocabulary, spelling coherence and cohesion, and different levels of formality.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Writes well-organized texts or articles about explaining the rules and regulations in his/her industry using appropriate grammar, vocabulary, spelling coherence and cohesion, and different levels of formality.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Writes well-organized texts or articles about explaining the rules and regulations in his/her industry using appropriate grammar, vocabulary, spelling coherence and cohesion, and different levels of formality.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Writes well-organized texts or articles about explaining the rules and regulations in his/her industry using appropriate grammar, vocabulary, spelling coherence and cohesion, and different levels of formality.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Writes well-organized texts or articles about explaining the rules and regulations in his/her industry using appropriate grammar, vocabulary, spelling coherence and cohesion, and different levels of formality.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Writes well-organized texts or articles about explaining the rules and regulations in his/her industry using appropriate grammar, vocabulary, spelling coherence and cohesion, and different levels of formality.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Writes well-organized texts or articles about explaining the rules and regulations in his/her industry using appropriate grammar, vocabulary, spelling coherence and cohesion, and different levels of formality.", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"content": "engenn8le10ob08re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Modals for Suggestions and Offers", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You can use modals to make suggestions.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You use <span class=\"italic\">Why don't we</span>/<span class=\"italic\">you</span>/<span class=\"italic\">I</span> to make casual suggestions.<br/> You use <span class=\"italic\">shall</span> to make a suggestion requesting permission or agreement. <span class=\"italic\">Shall</span> is also used in formal situations.<br/> You use <span class=\"italic\">could</span> with <span class=\"italic\">you</span>/<span class=\"italic\">we</span> to show a suggestion as being an  option.<br/> You use <span class=\"italic\">should</span> to make strong suggestions like advice.<br/>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "The wound should be cleaned with some antiseptic.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Why don't I get you a glass of water?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You could grab me a couple painkillers too, if you've got any.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Shall I meet you outside the Emergency Department?", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Passive of Modals", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "There are two basic patterns we use for passive modals.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "The first pattern is as follows:<br/>  <span class=\"strong\">modal + be + past participle</span><br />This is used to refer to present actions.<br/><br/>  Here are some examples:<br/> <ul><li><span class=\"italic\">can be seen</li> <li><span class=\"italic\">should be considered</li> <li><span class=\"italic\">would be auctioned</li> <li><span class=\"italic\">might be finished</li> <li><span class=\"italic\">must be paid</li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "The second pattern is a little longer: <br/> <span class=\"strong\">modal + have been + past participle</span><br />This is used for past actions.<br/><br/>  Here are some examples:<br/> <span class=\"italic\"><ul><li>could have been seen</li> <li>should have been covered</li> <li>might have been lost</li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "The kitchen should be considered off limits for you.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "It must be covered with a bandage too. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "The last thing you want is an infection because it should have been protected. ", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "take a peek", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to have a small look", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  Why don't you unwrap the towel and let me take a peek?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le10ob08aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you hear in a conversation between friends.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "antiseptic", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a substance that prevents infection in a wound by killing bacteria", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The wound should be cleaned with some antiseptic.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le10ob08aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "infection", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a disease caused by germs that enter the body", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The last thing you want is an infection.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le10ob08aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to swear by it", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to announce one's full faith and trust in someone or something", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It's made from natural products and they swear by it.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le10ob08aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "universe", "type": "name"}, {"content": "all of space and everything in it including stars, planets, galaxies ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  I think this is the universe telling me I should stay out of the kitchen!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le10ob08aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "blunt", "type": "name"}, {"content": "having a thick edge or point ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: A blunt knife would have caused a lot more damage.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le10ob08aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "ointment", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a smooth preparation that is rubbed on the skin for medicinal purposes ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I have some leftover ointment from a colleague from work.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le10ob08aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Write a 12-14-line dialogue between you and a friend about an injury or accident.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Describe what happened.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Was there a person available to help? What did they do?", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Use suggestions or offers like <span class=\"italic\">Why don't you ... ?</span> or <span class=\"italic\">You could ... </span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Include target words in your dialogue like <span class=\"italic\">ointment</span> and <span class=\"italic\">infection</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read the dialogue aloud with a partner.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I write a dialogue about an injury or accident.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I include suggestions and offers of assistance in a dialogue.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I read a dialogue about injuries and accidents with a partner.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn8le10ob08re2img01.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn8le10ob08re2img01.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: You're lucky you were using a sharp knife.  A blunt one would have caused a lot more damage.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I should have listened to you. Cutting away from myself might have been a better idea.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: One of the first rules of the kitchen ... watch your fingers. The kitchen should be considered off limits for you.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Should I be seen by a doctor at the Emergency Department? Then, it would be examined by professionals. There's blood everywhere!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:  Let's worry about that later. Why don't you unwrap the towel and let me take a peek."}, {"image": "engenn8le10ob08re2img05.jpg", "time": "30000", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: What's the verdict? Is my finger still attached?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Hmmm ... It doesn't look too bad actually. The cut's quite long but luckily not very deep.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I can't look. It's making me nauseous. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: The wound should be cleaned with some antiseptic. I think I've got some upstairs in the bathroom.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: You could grab me a couple painkillers too, if you've got any.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Sure. It must be covered with a bandage, too. It has to be done the right way.  The last thing you want is an infection because it should have been protected."}, {"image": "engenn8le10ob08re2img05.jpg", "time": "61000", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Absolutely not!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Actually, I have some leftover ointment a colleague from work gave me for burns and cuts. It's made with natural products and they swear by it.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: What's in it?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I'm not exactly sure. I can grab it while I'm up there.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I'll give it a try. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: You should be holding it up in the air. That will reduce the bleeding. Why don't I get you a glass of water? You look a bit pale.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I'm OK but I think this is the universe telling me that I should stay out of the kitchen!"}], "audiosrc": "engenn8le10ob08re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn8le10ob08re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "video", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "", "time": "5000", "id": 1, "text": "Making Suggestions"}, {"image": "", "time": "29000", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"bullet\">Using ... Why don't ...</span>"}, {"image": "", "time": "45000", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"bullet\">Using .. Shall ...</span>"}, {"image": "", "time": "61000", "id": 4, "text": "<span class=\"bullet\">Using .. Could ...</span>"}, {"image": "", "time": "79000", "id": 5, "text": "<span class=\"bullet\">Using .. Should ...</span>"}], "video_src": "engenn8le10ob08re3vid01"}, "type": "video"}], "id": 2}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " I can talk about injuries and accidents.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can make suggestions. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can discuss how to deal with problems.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " Have you ever cut yourself in the kitchen?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " Were you by yourself? What did you do?", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "Writing Spot: Nurse Vanessa to the Rescue", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "id": 0, "img_path": "", "stimuli_ids": [0]}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " Sally has cut herself while helping Vanessa prepare dinner. Should the kitchen be <span class=\"tool-tip\" id=\"tip_1_0\">off-limits</span> for Sally?", "type": "text"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Content", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"cont